LL(1) gramatika pre jazyk IFJ25
Štartovací symbol: Program

=== Povinný Prolog a kostra programu ===
Program -> Prolog TOKEN_NEW_LINE Main_class
Prolog -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_IMPORT TOKEN_STRING("ifj25") TOKEN_KEYWORD_FOR TOKEN_KEYWORD_IFJ  ##### Syntakticka chyba 2
Main_class -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_CLASS TOKEN_IDENTIFIER(Program) TOKEN_BLOCK_START TOKEN_NEW_LINE Main_class_block TOKEN_BLOCK_END TOKEN_NEW_LINE
Main_class_block -> Main_class_block_list Main_class_block | eps
Main_class_block_list -> Func_dec | Getter | Setter

=== Všeobecný block a jeho obsah ===
Block -> TOKEN_BLOCK_START TOKEN_NEW_LINE smth TOKEN_BLOCK_END TOKEN_NEW_LINE | TOKEN_BLOCK_START OnelineExprOpt TOKEN_BLOCK_END TOKEN_NEW_LINE 
smth -> smth_list TOKEN_NEW_LINE smth | eps
smth_list -> Return | Var | Assign | If | While | For | Break | Continue
OnelineExprOpt -> Expr | eps

=== Funkcie, Getter a Setter === 
Func_dec -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_STATIC TOKEN_IDENTIFIER TOKEN_LPAREN Param TOKEN_RPAREN Block
Param -> TOKEN_IDENTIFIER Param_list | eps
Param_list -> TOKEN_COMMA TOKEN_IDENTIFIER Param_list | eps 
Getter -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_STATIC TOKEN_IDENTIFIER Block
Setter -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_STATIC TOKEN_IDENTIFIER TOKEN_ASSIGN TOKEN_LPAREN TOKEN_IDENTIFIER TOKEN_RPAREN Block

=== Deklarovanie výrazu ===
Var -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_VAR TOKEN_IDENTIFIER Var_EXT
Var_EXT -> TOKEN_ASSIGN Var_EXTSTAT | eps 
Var_EXTSTAT -> Expr | TOKEN_FUNC_ID TOKEN_LPAREN Var_arg TOKEN_RPAREN | TOKEN_ID_GETTER
Var_arg -> Expr var_arg_list | eps
var_arg_list -> TOKEN_COMMA Expr var_arg_list | eps 

=== Všeobecné priradnie ====
Assign -> TOKEN_IDENTIFIER TOKEN_ASSIGN Expr | TOKEN_GLOBAL_ID TOKEN_ASSIGN Expr | TOKEN_SETTER_ID  TOKEN_ASSIGN Expr

=== if else podmienky ===
If -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_IF TOKEN_LPAREN Expr TOKEN_RPAREN Block Else 
Else ->  TOKEN_KEYWORD_ELSE Block | TOKEN_KEYWORD_ELSE If | eps

=== Cykly For a While === 
While -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_WHILE TOKEN_LPAREN Expr TOKEN_RPAREN Block
For -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_FOR TOKEN_LPAREN TOKEN_IDENTIFIER TOKEN_KEYWORD_IN Expr TOKEN_RPAREN Block
Break -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_BREAK
Continue -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_CONTINUE

=== Return pre EXTSTAT === 
Return -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_RETURN Return_expr
Return_expr -> Expr | eps


